{
  "meta": {
    "source": "LoA-LIRR-LFMM_EN v7.0 (19/03/2026)",
    "scope": "Interface Roma ACC (LIRR) <-> Marseille ACC (LFMM), Ajaccio APP et Bastia APP. Sections 2.2, 2.3, 3.1, 3.2.1 a 3.2.6.",
    "notScoped": "Section 2.1 (classification d'espace) non encodee.",
    "conventions": [
      "Les cles a l'interieur d'un bloc 'when' se combinent en ET logique : {dep:[...], arr:[...]} = departs de X a destination de Y.",
      "'fl' = niveau exact impose, 'maxFl' = plafond, 'minFl' = plancher, 'parity' = regle semi-circulaire.",
      "Repartition LIRR_NE / LIRR_EW deduite de la geographie des cartes 2.2.1 et 2.3 : NE pour les COP du nord (Elbe / Corse nord : DOBIM, MIRSA, MOULE, DOKAR), EW pour tous les COP de la Sardaigne. La LoA ne l'attribue pas COP par COP.",
      "Cote LFMM seul LFMM_E_CTR est concerne par cette LoA (2.2.2)."
    ],
    "disclaimer": "FOR SIMULATION USE ONLY - NOT VALID FOR REAL OPERATIONS"
  },

  "stations": {
    "LIRR_NE_CTR":  { "freq": "124.200", "name": "Roma Radar (NE)", "fallback": [],
                      "note": "Secteur primaire. Quand seul LIRR_NE_CTR est ouvert, il couvre aussi le secteur NW (2.2.1)" },
    "LIRR_EW_CTR":  { "freq": "127.125", "name": "Roma Radar (EW)", "fallback": [],
                      "note": "Secteur primaire, Sardaigne" },
    "LIEO_EW0_APP": { "freq": "125.950", "name": "Roma Radar (EW0)", "fallback": ["LIRR_EW_CTR"],
                      "note": "SFC-FL105" },
    "LIRR_NW_CTR":  { "freq": "124.800", "name": "Roma Radar (NW)", "fallback": ["LIRR_NE_CTR"],
                      "note": "Secteur secondaire" },
    "LFMM_CTR":     { "freq": "128.850", "name": "Marseille Control", "fallback": [] },
    "LFMM_E_CTR":   { "freq": "127.905", "name": "Marseille Control (East)", "fallback": ["LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFKJ_APP":     { "freq": "121.050", "name": "Ajaccio Approach", "fallback": ["LFMM_E_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFKB_APP":     { "freq": "123.825", "name": "Bastia Approach", "fallback": ["LFMM_E_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"] }
  },

  "defaults": {
    "general": [
      "Le trafic est repute maintenir le niveau coordonne au COP sauf condition de montee/descente explicite (3.1).",
      "Toute deviation (COP, route, FL) impose une approval request (3.1).",
      "Silent handover possible a 10 NM, obligatoire si separation longitudinale < 20 NM (3.1)."
    ]
  },

